{"2971960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Find Your Words", "steam_appid": 2971960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4541080], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the first day of summer camp and adventures await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/6db982a59e96470716aea14039959e20.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/6db982a59e96470716aea14039959e20.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=150 /></span>Adventure at your own pace and soak in the lush world of Camp Pals, brimming with wildlife, stunning vistas, and charming characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/a4ee2107b9a7cc2e54f1a0d2d1e1c195.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/a4ee2107b9a7cc2e54f1a0d2d1e1c195.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/a4ee2107b9a7cc2e54f1a0d2d1e1c195.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/b34e53e37d8663c9444ed36ef659f291.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/b34e53e37d8663c9444ed36ef659f291.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the scenic grounds and meet the other campers, each bursting with personality. Uncover your new friends’ lovable quirks as you spend time with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/9997ff8435d787c492986e2de3321f0c.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/9997ff8435d787c492986e2de3321f0c.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/9997ff8435d787c492986e2de3321f0c.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/be5fb4d6f20a304215ce81bdbeb1b510.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/be5fb4d6f20a304215ce81bdbeb1b510.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=140 /></span>Collect new symbols for your communication binder by exploring and playing with friends. Different combinations of symbols have unique meanings, and allow you to discover new interactions and activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/695103e8e7d115cd68f9b9be9adc05cc.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/695103e8e7d115cd68f9b9be9adc05cc.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/695103e8e7d115cd68f9b9be9adc05cc.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/b08b9615e4d9cf29f3e8314b6cfec761.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/b08b9615e4d9cf29f3e8314b6cfec761.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=156 /></span>As you deepen your friendships with campers, you’ll discover new shared activities. You might inspire a budding artist, play hide and seek, or even hit the stage with your own new dance.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/bd01e3e9b633a22f9b5817a69c71efb7.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/bd01e3e9b633a22f9b5817a69c71efb7.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/bd01e3e9b633a22f9b5817a69c71efb7.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by two dads, inspired by their non-speaking kids’ journeys using AAC (Augmentative and Alternative Communication). Our hope is to shine a light on the ways we communicate beyond speech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the award-winning studio behind Grindstone and Below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the first day of summer camp and adventures await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/6db982a59e96470716aea14039959e20.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/6db982a59e96470716aea14039959e20.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=150 /></span>Adventure at your own pace and soak in the lush world of Camp Pals, brimming with wildlife, stunning vistas, and charming characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/a4ee2107b9a7cc2e54f1a0d2d1e1c195.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/a4ee2107b9a7cc2e54f1a0d2d1e1c195.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/a4ee2107b9a7cc2e54f1a0d2d1e1c195.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/b34e53e37d8663c9444ed36ef659f291.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/b34e53e37d8663c9444ed36ef659f291.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the scenic grounds and meet the other campers, each bursting with personality. Uncover your new friends’ lovable quirks as you spend time with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/9997ff8435d787c492986e2de3321f0c.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/9997ff8435d787c492986e2de3321f0c.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/9997ff8435d787c492986e2de3321f0c.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/be5fb4d6f20a304215ce81bdbeb1b510.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/be5fb4d6f20a304215ce81bdbeb1b510.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=140 /></span>Collect new symbols for your communication binder by exploring and playing with friends. Different combinations of symbols have unique meanings, and allow you to discover new interactions and activities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/695103e8e7d115cd68f9b9be9adc05cc.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/695103e8e7d115cd68f9b9be9adc05cc.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/695103e8e7d115cd68f9b9be9adc05cc.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/b08b9615e4d9cf29f3e8314b6cfec761.avif?t=1776176779\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras_big/b08b9615e4d9cf29f3e8314b6cfec761.webp?t=1776176779 width=1560 height=156 /></span>As you deepen your friendships with campers, you’ll discover new shared activities. You might inspire a budding artist, play hide and seek, or even hit the stage with your own new dance.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/bd01e3e9b633a22f9b5817a69c71efb7.poster.avif?t=1776176779\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/bd01e3e9b633a22f9b5817a69c71efb7.webm?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/extras/bd01e3e9b633a22f9b5817a69c71efb7.mp4?t=1776176779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by two dads, inspired by their non-speaking kids’ journeys using AAC (Augmentative and Alternative Communication). Our hope is to shine a light on the ways we communicate beyond speech. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the award-winning studio behind Grindstone and Below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Find your community at summer camp, one friendship at a time. Take a beat, enjoy a breath of fresh air - all while playing at the beach, strolling in the woods, and dancing with friends. This short cozy game was created by two dads, celebrating their kids’ journeys to find their voices.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/b9237ac5779b0f119d4e0e28b6831fd037a1932c/header.jpg?t=1776176779", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971960/4f97875d